        "original_id": "eab0c1a0-5c5e-580c-818f-34f8cf11ef44",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Spanky, DJ Pierre, Herb J, Paul Woolford, Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim, Al Tourettes\n- Groups/Labels: Phuture, Halocyan Records\n- Places: Chicago, Los Angeles, United Kingdom, continental Europe\n- Genres/Scenes: acid house, electronic music, rave scene, techno\n\nFacts:\n- Phuture was founded in 1985 in Chicago, United States, by Spanky, DJ Pierre, and Herb J.\n- Phuture is an American acid-house group of electronic musicians based in Chicago.\n- Acid house spread to the United Kingdom and continental Europe, where DJs played it in the acid house scene and later in the rave scene.\n- Halocyan Records is based in Los Angeles, California.\n- Halocyan Records has released music by DJ Pierre of Phuture, Paul Woolford, Joey Beltram, Vladislav Delay as Sistol, ASC, xxxy, Appleblim and Al Tourettes, and Extrawelt.",
